        }
      },
      "children": {
        "true": [
          {
            "id": "55f74f77-60e8-4190-a085-9334e12a1f9d",
            "command": "EVENT_GROUP",
            "args": {},
            "children": {
              "true": [
                {
                  "id": "697909c6-7d01-4e6c-a566-ae2dafd7f99f",
                  "command": "EVENT_HIDE_SPRITES",
                  "args": {}
                },
                {
                  "id": "9606548d-489c-438f-a26a-dc4e9d15a0dd",
                  "command": "EVENT_TEXT",
                  "args": {
                    "text": [
                      "Mara asks whether\nthe newer sale\nproposal means she\nmust call a",
                      "private estate\noffice. Consider\nthe dates,\nsignatures, and\nthe rule",
                      "about entering a\ndeed. Which\nconclusion can the\nclerk support? Pip",
                      "will put it on her\nreferral card and\nsign his name, so\na confident",
                      "guess could send\nher back into the\ncold."
                    ],
                    "avatarId": "",
                    "minHeight": 4,
                    "maxHeight": 7,
                    "position": "bottom",
                    "closeWhen": "key",
                    "closeButton": "a"
                  }
                },
                {
                  "id": "850eec11-3a8c-4fc1-aa85-76c37202ea2a",
                  "command": "EVENT_SHOW_SPRITES",
                  "args": {}
                }
              ]
            }
          }
        ],
        "false": []
      }
    },
